Description: AegisNova OS — Blue-Team Meta-Package
 Installs all defensive security tools included in AegisNova OS.
 Categories: Network Monitoring, EDR/Endpoint, Log & SIEM,
 Forensics, Vulnerability Management, Threat Intel, Hardening,
 and Observability.
 .
 Includes: Suricata, Zeek, Wireshark, Wazuh, ELK Stack,
 Volatility3, Autopsy, Lynis, YARA, ClamAV, Prometheus,
 Grafana, bpftrace, and more.
 .
 NOTE: These tools are for authorized defensive operations only.
